# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# Set to 1 to show a persistent "DEMO" badge in the app header
# (used by the enterprise demo environment — Step 5).
# VITE_DEMO_MODE=1
# Uncomment the line above for production/staging builds.
# In development, the app uses relative URLs through the Vite dev server proxy
# (configured in vite.config.ts), so no API base URL is needed.
